ort-the-test-statistic-in-context-when-possible.-7","chapter":"18 Chi-square test for independence","heading":"18.8.2 Report the test statistic in context (when possible).","text":"value \\(\\chi^{2}\\) 5.004813.Commentary: last chapter, ’s much context report value \\(\\chi^{2}\\), can just report full sentence.","code":""},{"path":"chi-square-test-for-independence.html","id":"plot-the-null-distribution.-7","chapter":"18 Chi-square test for independence","heading":"18.8.3 Plot the null distribution.","text":"","code":"\nlow_race_test <- birthwt2 %>%\n  specify(response = low_fct, explanatory = race_fct) %>%\n  assume(distribution = \"chisq\")\nlow_race_test## A Chi-squared distribution with 2 degrees of freedom.\nlow_race_test %>%\n  visualize() +\n  shade_p_value(obs_chisq, direction = \"greater\")"},{"path":"chi-square-test-for-independence.html","id":"calculate-the-p-value.-7","chapter":"18 Chi-square test for independence","heading":"18.8.4 Calculate the P-value.","text":"","code":"\nlow_race_test_p <- low_race_test %>%\n  get_p_value(obs_chisq, direction = \"greater\")\nlow_race_test_p"},{"path":"chi-square-test-for-independence.html","id":"interpret-the-p-value-as-a-probability-given-the-null.-7","chapter":"18 Chi-square test for independence","heading":"18.8.5 Interpret the P-value as a probability given the null.","text":"P-value 0.0818877. low birth weight race independent, 8.1887698% chance seeing results least extreme saw data.","code":""},{"path":"chi-square-test-for-independence.html","id":"conclusion-9","chapter":"18 Chi-square test for independence","heading":"18.9 Conclusion","text":"","code":""},{"path":"chi-square-test-for-independence.html","id":"state-the-statistical-conclusion.-7","chapter":"18 Chi-square test for independence","heading":"18.9.1 State the statistical conclusion.","text":"fail reject null hypothesis.","code":""},{"path":"chi-square-test-for-independence.html","id":"state-but-do-not-overstate-a-contextually-meaningful-conclusion.